# DPCS — Build Methodology

Follow **[docs/DPCS_BUILD_METHODOLOGY.md](docs/DPCS_BUILD_METHODOLOGY.md)** on **every** task. Same pipeline for all products in this monorepo.

```
PHASE 0  Constitution   scope, stack, non-negotiables, exclusions
PHASE 1  PRD            behaviour only — ZERO code
PHASE 2  Contract       headers only, compile-checked
PHASE 3  Module         ONE .cpp per run, explicit file allowlist
PHASE 4  Verify         script exits 0, or it isn't done
```

**Core laws:** DONE = commands exit 0; zero code in Phase 1; one module per Phase 3 run; upstream by path (cite files, not chat memory).

**Debug:** facts → ≤3 hypotheses → root-cause proof paragraph **before** fix → minimal fix → regression test.

Also respect [architecture-documentation.mdc](architecture-documentation.mdc), [security-baseline.mdc](security-baseline.mdc), and product `ARCHITECTURE.md`.

**Plugin / greenfield products:** [PLUGIN_FACTORY_OS_PROMPT.md](docs/PLUGIN_FACTORY_OS_PROMPT.md) §0 is a compatible slice template inside DPCS — do not skip Constitution or Verify.

**DiskLordz content-only roadmap** (optional): [disklordz-content-platform.mdc](disklordz-content-platform.mdc) when editing ROM Factory / ROMpler content paths.
